---
title: "session_middleware (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_path: receive NextRequest
    q_check_path --> q_skip: path matches static asset pattern
    q_check_path --> q_update_session: path does not match exclusion pattern
    q_skip --> [*]: pass through without processing
    q_update_session --> [*]: updateSession(request) refreshes Supabase auth cookies

    note right of q_check_path
        INV-001: static assets (_next/static, _next/image, favicon, images) are excluded from session processing
        INV-002: all non-static routes trigger session refresh on every request
    end note

    note right of q_update_session
        INV-003: session token is refreshed before reaching route handlers
    end note
